{"id":"852a6bf29c9fad95","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-set-family.md","title":"Set Family","display":"df-set-family — Set Family","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-set-family","aliases":["58-df-set-family"],"display":"df-set-family — Set Family","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-set-family"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-set-family</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-set-family — Set Family"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,A\\in V\">\\(I,A\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SetFamily}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{SetFamily}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}family}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SetFamily}_S(A,I)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists U\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Function}(A,I,\\mathcal P(U)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}family}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SetFamily}_S(A,I)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists U\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Function}(A,I,\\mathcal P(U)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A set-indexed family is a function with domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> whose values are sets. The witness <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=\\bigcup_{i\\in I}A(i)\">\\(U=\\bigcup_{i\\in I}A(i)\\)</span> can always be chosen.</li>\n<li>The index set is part of the predicate; a unary predicate lost this information.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (from [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I,A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SetFamily}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}set\\text{-}family}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SetFamily}_S(A,I)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists U\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Function}(A,I,\\mathcal P(U)).","display":true},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"U=\\bigcup_{i\\in I}A(i)","display":false}],"bytes":794,"backlinks":[{"id":"9e4fb9751cf37385","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal F\\in V$ (nonempty set family, see [[../batch10/58-df-set-family.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1143","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-set-family.md|58-df-set-family]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751"]}